<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys shrs off market at $6.64.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys shrs off market at $6.64.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it had bought back 257,170 shares off market on Monday, at NZ$6.64 each, as part of its share buyback programme.</p>
<p>This represented 0.0139 percent of the total number of issued shares in Telecom at the beginning of Monday's session.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said the total number of issued shares in Telecom following the latest purchase was 1,830,766,261, excluding 25.6 million shares held as treasury stock.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
